Third-party data

The 3D model files derived from BodyParts3D (public/models/*.glb and
src/data/generated/*-meta.json) are NOT covered by the MIT License in LICENSE.
They are adapted from:

  BodyParts3D, (c) The Database Center for Life Science
  licensed under CC Attribution 4.0 International
  https://dbarchive.biosciencedbc.jp/en/bodyparts3d/lic.html

Changes: cropped into upper-body regions (neck, shoulder, thorax, back, abdomen,
right arm, forearm, hand), limb regions straightened along the bone axis, large
meshes decimated with meshoptimizer, converted from mm to cm and from OBJ to
glTF; the combined view mirrors the right limb to show the left; skin/fascia shells and nerve
paths were generated and are approximations.
